        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Petersen\n- Organizations: Boise State Broncos football, Mountain West Conference, University of Washington\n- Places: Bronco Stadium\n- Events: 2013 Boise State Broncos football team, 2013 Mountain West Conference football season\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Petersen was born on October 13, 1964.\n- Chris Petersen is an American football coach and is the head coach at the University of Washington.\n- In 2013, the Boise State Broncos football team was led by eighth-year head coach Chris Petersen.\n- In 2013, the Boise State Broncos football team played its home games at Bronco Stadium.\n- In the 2013 NCAA Division I FBS football season, the Mountain West Conference had 12 football members: Air Force, Boise State, Colorado State, Fresno State, Hawaiʻi, Nevada, New Mexico, San Diego State, San Jose State, UNLV, Utah State, and Wyoming.",
